Heya!

  This is a simple pastebin / temporary file hoster.
  Take a look at the API or use the webform below.
  Pasting is heavily rate limited.

API

  POST {{URL}}/

    Make a paste with the raw data sent along.

    Use with the parameter 's' to generate a longer URL and encrypt the
    content server-side (XSalsa20-Poly1305). Use the parameter 'ext'
    to specify the file extension. Note: use the '.file' extension to
    always make the link download the file.

    If the response code is 201 (CREATED), then the paste was successfully
    uploaded. Any other response code signifies an error.

    File size is capped at 5M.

  GET {{URL}}/<id>[/<key>]

    Retrieve a paste with the given id as plaintext.

    If the paste was stored encrypted, you also need to specify a
    decryption key.

  DELETE {{URL}}/<id>[/<key>]

    Delete the paste with the given id.

    Note: All pastes have a default lifetime of 30 days.

EXAMPLES:

  Create a paste:

    {{stylecode}}{{CURL}}{{/stylecode}}
  Or from stdin:

    {{stylecode}}{{CURL_STDIN}}{{/stylecode}}
  Delete paste:

    {{stylecode}}{{CURL_DELETE}}{{/stylecode}}
  Shell helper function:

{{stylecode}}{{SCRIPT}}{{/stylecode}}
